WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:05,770
Who uses quilt chicken balls

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,210
That big guy has something to keep warm.

3
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,610
I'm almost turning into a popsicle

4
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:10,330
My car dealership is Level 2

5
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,690
I can handle the tide

6
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:12,850
But in the carriage with the Ice Cult, there are also

7
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,050
I turned up the air conditioner to the highest level

8
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:15,090
But it doesn't work at all

9
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,210
Minus 52 degrees in the wild

10
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,050
I'm afraid it's colder than the 70 degrees in the city

11
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,700
Why don't you just wear thicker clothes last night?

12
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,770
It doesn’t look like it’s going to work anymore. Are you still alive?

13
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,250
Boss is still alive

14
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:27,690
It’s just that the fingers are already moving

15
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,130
I almost didn't make it last night

16
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,770
How are you guys doing? Are you okay? Not so good.

17
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,130
I put on two cotton coats

18
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,810
As soon as I got off the car, the cold wind hurt me to the bone.

19
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,340
I have a green fur suit with built-in heating function

20
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,860
Ability to function normally at minus 50 degrees Celsius in the wild

21
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,900
Two vehicle upgrade fragments or two ball arms need to be sent directly
